            <DropLocation>ToEE: Depths of the Temple, end chest (confirmed), ToEE: Air Node, dragon's hoard chests, ToEE: Fire Node, Periron chest, ToEE: Water Node, Jotun Rimeblade chest, and ToEE: Earth Node, Hyrelgas chest</DropLocation>
