          <Necklace>
            <Name>Symbol of the Shining Sun</Name>
            <Icon>Necklace_1</Icon>
            <Description>This golden amulet is the width of a man's fist, and is in the shape of a perfect,
circular sun, with twelve spokes emerging at regular intervals around the periphery.</Description>
            <DropLocation>Eveningstar, Turn in 5 Commendations: Clerics of the Amaunator Commendation: Clerics of Amaunator : This is a valuable item that can be exchanged for goods if brought to a Challenge Trader. This is a token of favor earned by helping the Clerics of Amaunator. You can exchange it in Eveningstar for powerful equipment.</DropLocation>
            <MinLevel>20</MinLevel>
            <EquipmentSlot>
              <Necklace/>
            </EquipmentSlot>
            <Material>Gold</Material>
            <Buff>
              <Type>AbilityBonus</Type>
              <Value1>7</Value1>
