            <Name>Cloak of Flames (level 7)</Name>
            <Icon>Cloak_15</Icon>
            <Description>Imbued with the power of a bound Fire Elemental, this smooth cloak of crimson
fabric absorbs harmful flames and makes your fire spells stronger.</Description>
            <DropLocation>Vaults of the Artificers, Turn in various ingredients</DropLocation>
